v4crIeWShU.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#50bbe4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21319-U2RmvTzscBT3.jpg"},"description":"The story is set on an archipelago of four islands far south of Japan or even the South Seas. It is all but a different world from modern Japan. From the discovery of anti-gravitons came the dream invention of anti-graviton shoes that let people fly the skies. They introduce people to a new realm by enabling flight with just one's own body strength, without feathers or engines. This led to the rise of the sport of \"Flying Circus\".<br>\n<br>\nThe protagonist who once hoped for a future in this sport suffered a setback due to an overwhelming defeat, and withdrew from the sport for this and some other reason. However, he met the transfer student Asuka Kurashina, and in teaching her to fly the skies, the old passion returned. He takes part in the Flying Circus again.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":3,"year":2016},"episodes":12,"externalLinks":[{"language":null,"site":"Official Site","type":"INFO","url":"http://aokana-anime.com/"},{"language":null,"site":"Twitter","type":"SOCIAL","url":"https://twitter.com/aokana_TVanime"},{"language":null,"site":"Crunchyroll","type":"STREAMING","url":"http://www.crunchyroll.com/aokana"}],"genres":["Drama","Sci-Fi","Sports"],"hashtag":"#aokana_anime #あおかなアニメ","isLicensed":true,"meanScore":63,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":76,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":2016},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":17,"season":"WINTER","type":"RATED","year":2016},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":16,"season":"WINTER","type":"POPULAR","year":2016}],"relations":[["ALTERNATIVE",96282,93991,"MANGA","MANGA"]],"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2016,"source":"VISUAL_NOVEL","startDate":{"day":12,"month":1,"year":2016},"st